      "content": "That's a great start, really nice flow. The tone is exactly where it needs to be. \n\nI just ran it through the internal tool and it's coming back with a pretty low vocabulary richness score. Marketing is being a bit pushy about it—they want to see that number climb so the draft looks \"premium\" in the system. \n\nCan you try a second version? Try to lean into those more descriptive, sophisticated adjectives to get that score up. Just a reminder though: please don't make it feel forced or like a list of adjectives; it still has to feel like a high-end luxury brand story.",
